{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6000_place", "source_sha256": "8cfda54cfc1fbdcca4c695f7cd552787726b09b31556b1987aaee91a4df98109", "ja": "商店街", "zh": "商店街", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6001_p", "source_sha256": "90cf656d66f05e36f4f9043bc488d6cf3ccdc21ec2a1ef1c8a9513e534423163", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nカメラマンさんの提案で、海美も構図を考えている）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n在摄影师的提议下，海美也在考虑拍摄构图。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6002_029umi", "source_sha256": "e101b5315f5bc4253009722a010c13467d3b76b367c75c32d860e0b8c4667a35", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}！\n考えたんだけど……塀の上を歩くなんてどうかな！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}先生！  \n我想了想……在围墙上走怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6003_p", "source_sha256": "9b044e464ec898c07efc60f94a71fcd98e502a53c0ea502c235dadf840f636ae", "ja": "塀の上を……。そうだな。\n猫らしい雰囲気も出せそうだし、いいんじゃないか！", "zh": "在围墙上走啊……也是呢。\n既能表现出猫咪的气氛，这主意很不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6004_029umi", "source_sha256": "e2dfee42a4aec8dee09717f62f00fed69d004f26e62f3d63a63c65b4b7fd0f41", "ja": "やったー！　それじゃあ、一つ目は決まりね！\n他に、ネコって感じがしそうなのは……えーっと。", "zh": "太好啦！那么，第一个就定下来咯！\n其他还有什么地方会有猫咪的感觉呢……唔——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6005_029umi", "source_sha256": "faef2a2fccac4c5e4c7bd73dcf9aea694a452687ae8458587875aec9d35d8bc3", "ja": "あ！　あの路地裏とかいいと思わない？\nなんだかネコの通り道って感じがするよね☆", "zh": "啊！那条小巷子感觉不是很不错吗？\n总觉得很有猫咪小道的感觉呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6006_p", "source_sha256": "79c1dc13526a34fffb744f6447f3f1e32fa8f280bd8f47319e20e8c95bf9bb2c", "ja": "ああ、たしかに！\nよし、それも追加で相談してみよう。", "zh": "啊，确实！\n好，那也去和他们商量着加进去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6007_029umi", "source_sha256": "5e6dbddec16229838c15e789b1f2d6e5ef1eb097bf95b1f413fa68b2ceae8d1c", "ja": "それから、それから……うう～。ネコの目線で見ると\n全部が撮影スポットに見えちゃうよ～！", "zh": "还有，还有……呜呜～。从猫咪的视角看，所有地方都像是拍摄景点啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6008_p", "source_sha256": "b4618ca27a0dee47c7537fc850c7b36c07b4b16b76f46d35c756f603ded8305a", "ja": "ははっ。猫の気持ちで考えたなら、\n海美が思いついた構図は、どれも正解かもな。", "zh": "哈哈。如果从猫咪的心情来考虑，海美想出来的构图，说不定全都对呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6009_029umi", "source_sha256": "501ef0a9d2afb1368e7baa4feb2e421330340d9efb171a217296cc5b67ca645b", "ja": "ん～……じゃあさ！　{$P$}なら\nどんな写真があったら嬉しい？", "zh": "嗯～……那么！如果是{$P$}的话，\n有怎样的照片会让你开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6010_p", "source_sha256": "c6c5a7ea0197df3db3cedfd4ad8b903ce63562e232844b3f3a3a08a39057fc96", "ja": "うーん、そうだな。たとえば……。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛。比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6011", "source_sha256": "10616d42396b9d6f3a913ba2c67c86110908ce74e4a45a5f32ba57ff757c516c", "ja": "屋根の上", "zh": "屋顶上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6012", "source_sha256": "8fe7065e7d5034d8aedfee55376bfccead5b68f483a3cc58a35b7f29dda03a40", "ja": "魚屋", "zh": "鱼店", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6013", "source_sha256": "6fdfc360639a810821b300b97eb1695ee2c5d9bac90ff5cc32b654ea04df2974", "ja": "猫の集会", "zh": "猫咪聚会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6100_p", "source_sha256": "ced8707fc948d88c38ddf593cb966a65e1cb4196039fd83a2bf11b9d0883f7f4", "ja": "屋根の上でのんびりしてる姿は可愛いかもな。\nとはいえ、塀と違って高すぎるからな……。", "zh": "在屋顶上悠闲放松的样子的确很可爱。\n但话虽如此，屋顶可不像围墙，实在太高了点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6101_029umi", "source_sha256": "3181e3298f0143ffc7d7f75db80218da5573c5138d2f19580dc76b04315f750f", "ja": "ううん、全然大丈夫☆　高いところはボルダリングで\n慣れてるし、バランス感覚も自信あるからね！", "zh": "嗯，完全没问题☆我平时攀岩已经习惯高处了，平衡感也很有自信呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6102_029umi", "source_sha256": "8e631e1f306b055350c67ec8355f2cbf5647d8ed1eb772ca12babbaee3e29782", "ja": "屋根の上でのんびりか～！　すっごく気持ちよさそう♪\n{$P$}、アイディアありがとうね！", "zh": "在屋顶上悠闲放松啊～！感觉超级舒服呢♪\n{$P$}，谢谢你的好点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6200_p", "source_sha256": "2491820726bb6d226cc83c0d3410e02edd261aa225398aa014c171ef0ad29193", "ja": "魚屋で魚の争奪戦なんてどうだ？　「ネコの海美と\n店主の、魚を賭けた一騎打ち！」みたいな。", "zh": "去鱼店展开一场抢鱼大战怎么样？就像“猫咪海美与店主展开赌上鱼的单挑！”这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6201_029umi", "source_sha256": "05288f29c1914fc03718854e41a0bb0887169a5e5dc228a8773f0441d1408775", "ja": "あははっ！　いいね、楽しそう！\n商店街にいるネコならではって感じでいいかも！", "zh": "啊哈哈！不错呢，听起来很好玩！\n很有商店街猫咪的特色，感觉挺棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6202_029umi", "source_sha256": "14b9f70787fb09ce7e260084c9795b836428a592fbee651b876c0402c47f2375", "ja": "それなら、魚屋さんに出演のお願いしないとだね！\nそれじゃ早速、行こうよ！　……うみみんダーッシュ☆", "zh": "那样的话，就得去拜托鱼店老板出演了呢！\n那我们马上出发吧！……海美冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6300_p", "source_sha256": "0e03350fb5718ec0d80df7b17bd293ae56105a925a5c7227234bc7a9115df172", "ja": "猫の集会に参加してみるなんてどうだろう？\n猫達と一緒にいる姿は絵になりそうな気がするけど。", "zh": "要不要试着参加猫咪的集会？\n我觉得和猫咪们待在一起的样子，应该会很上镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6301_029umi", "source_sha256": "3984778a9be4e74d1558f82cca6aba33a7c9271fe40201c30e383427fcf1bdcd", "ja": "わあ～、ネコと一緒に集会か。たしかに面白いかも！\nどこでやってるか、近くにいたネコたちに聞いて……。", "zh": "哇～，和猫一起参加集会啊。确实可能会很有意思！\n去问问附近的猫，看看它们在哪里举行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_6302_029umi", "source_sha256": "f0b40215d4fa16617562944191e7a78986b0b0feb1669bad650b37fece34bcb2", "ja": "あれ？　あれ？　ネコたち、いなくなっちゃった！？\n{$P$}、どうしよ～う！？", "zh": "咦？咦？猫咪们怎么不见了！？\n{$P$}，该怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
